  "prefLabel": "En 1502.06 Communication line",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1502.06 \"Communication line\" means a utility line and any associated conductors and supporting or containing structures, equipment, and apparatus that is used for the purpose of public or private data signal or other communications service.\n\nSource. #13939, eff 4-26-24",
